    <statement><p>If <m>\displaystyle \int_{-2}^{4}\! f(x) \, dx = -5</m>, <m>\displaystyle \int_{2}^{4}\! f(x) \, dx = 14,</m> and <m>\displaystyle \int_{-2}^{4}\! g(x) \, dx = 8,</m> find the following integrals.</p>
